# Third-party licences of the helper

The helper program `typst-workshop-helper` is built from the Rust crates listed below, under the licences whose texts follow. The licence of OpenSSL, which the linux-x64 helper contains, and the notices of typst-assets (the fonts and data files the helper embeds), hayagriva (its CSL styles and locales) and subsetter come last. This file is generated from `helper/Cargo.lock` by cargo-about (`npm run licenses:helper`) for the release platforms x86_64-unknown-linux-musl, aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-apple-darwin.

